  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614680376573-df3480f0c6ff?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "The weapon grid (10 slots) is the primary power system—the correct grid configuration for your element and character composition provides a larger damage increase than character rarity or level.",
      "Charge Attack (CA) sequences trigger character CA cutscenes that deal bonus damage—chain characters' CA animations without interrupting the sequence by skills to maximise the CA damage multiplier.",
      "Support summons from friends provide essential multiplier bonuses—invite friends with fully uncapped legendary summons (Bahamut, Lucifer, Primal Grid) and select them as support for content that requires their passive aura.",
      "Rise of the Beasts (RoTB) and Arcarum events provide the most impactful upgrade materials that cannot be obtained through standard raid farming—prioritise completing their respective solo content during event windows.",
      "The crew system (guild equivalent) provides access to crew raids and crew buffs—joining an active 30-member crew that regularly completes Unite and Fight (guild war) events doubles monthly Crystal income from guild participation rewards."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "ウェポングリッド（10スロット）は主要なパワーシステム。属性とキャラクター構成に合った正しいグリッド設定はキャラクターのレアリティやレベルより大きなダメージ増加を提供する。",
      "チャージアタック（CA）シーケンスはボーナスダメージを与えるキャラクターのCAカットシーンをトリガーする。CAダメージ乗数を最大化するためにスキルでシーケンスを中断せずにキャラクターのCAアニメーションをチェーンする。",
      "フレンドからのサポート召喚は必要な乗数ボーナスを提供する。完全に上限解放された伝説の召喚（バハムート、ルシファー、プライマルグリッド）を持つフレンドを招待し、パッシブオーラを必要とするコンテンツのサポートとして選択する。",
      "六竜戦（RoTB）とアーカルム探索は標準的なレイドファーミングでは入手できない最も影響力のあるアップグレード素材を提供する。イベントウィンドウ中にそれぞれのソロコンテンツを完了することを優先する。",
      "クルーシステム（ギルド相当）はクルーレイドとクルーバフへのアクセスを提供する。ユナイト&ファイト（ギルド戦）イベントを定期的に完了する30人のアクティブなクルーに参加すると、ギルド参加報酬から月次のクリスタル収入が2倍になる。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Element Focus and Relink Connection",
        "body": "Choose one primary element early and build all resources toward that element—cross-element teams are significantly weaker than mono-element teams at mid-to-endgame. Fire, Wind, and Earth are the most resource-efficient starting elements due to the availability of free event characters that cover the essential archetypes. Avoid spreading between elements until your primary element has a complete Omega weapon grid (10 weapons with appropriate skills)."
      },
      {
        "title": "Daily and Free Quest Farming",
        "body": "The daily free quests (Main Quest Chapter 2-5 onwards) provide materials for character levelling—farm the highest available free quest every day before spending AP on event content. The casino (available after story progress) provides casino chips exchangeable for high-value summons; complete the casino daily quest for chip income even when not actively grinding casino content."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Omega Raids and Grid Building",
        "body": "Omega raids (Tiamat, Colossus, Leviathan, Yggdrasil, Luminiera, Celeste) provide weapon drops for the core grid. Prioritise the Omega raid matching your element: Fire players target Colossus, Wind targets Tiamat. Each Omega weapon type (Omega Sword, Omega Dagger, etc.) has specific grid utility—Omega weapons with the Omega skill active on your summon call receive a 150% buff, making them the highest-value grid slots for new players."
      },
      {
        "title": "Unite & Fight (Guild War) Strategy",
        "body": "Unite & Fight occurs monthly and is the primary source of exclusive characters and high-value badges. The NM (Nightmare) boss battles provide the most tokens per honour point—unlock NM tier by accumulating token medals from regular boss battles. During Guild War, maximise manual battle efficiency: auto-battle clears standard nodes faster in aggregate, but manual clearing of NM150+ provides 3–5× the token income per AP spent versus auto standard nodes."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Revans Weapons and Transcendence",
        "body": "Revans weapons (from Six Dragon, Revans raids) represent the highest-tier weapon grid components. Assembling a full Revans grid requires clearing Revans raids at Impossible+ difficulty—this requires a complete pre-Revans grid (Omega or Primal) plus a capable support summon from friends or your own roster. Transcendence (level cap increase beyond 100) provides the final stat multiplier layer and requires specific materials from Revans content. Transcending your primary DPS character is the single highest-impact progression step in Revans-era GBF."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Spreading resources across multiple elements simultaneously—GBF's power scaling is element-specific; a complete single-element setup is exponentially more powerful than two half-built setups.",
      "Using Draw Tickets on non-promotional banners—Draw Tickets from events have the same pull rates as regular rolls; save them for guaranteed draws or use them during seasonal promotional periods with higher featured rates.",
      "Ignoring the Fate Episode (character story) system—Fate Episodes unlock character uncap tiers and passive stat bonuses; a character at level 100 with 0 Fate Episodes completed has lower effective stats than the same character with all Fate Episodes read.",
      "Not auto-battling standard raid content—GBF's standard raids (below Impossible difficulty) can be auto-battled efficiently with a properly built team; manually clearing standard content is a time inefficiency at mid-game and above.",
      "Missing Proving Grounds (Tower of Babyl) events—the Tower provides the most efficient source of Revans weapons and is only available during limited event windows; missing it significantly delays endgame weapon grid completion."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "複数の属性に同時にリソースを分散する。GBFのパワースケーリングは属性固有。完全な単一属性セットアップは2つの半分構築されたセットアップより指数関数的に強力。",
      "非プロモーションバナーにドローチケットを使う。イベントからのドローチケットは通常ロールと同じ引き率を持つ。保証されたドローやより高いフィーチャー率のある季節プロモーション期間のために貯める。",
      "フェイトエピソード（キャラクターストーリー）システムを無視する。フェイトエピソードはキャラクターの上限解放ティアとパッシブステータスボーナスをアンロックする。フェイトエピソード0完了のレベル100のキャラクターは、全フェイトエピソードを読んだ同じキャラクターより実効ステータスが低い。",
      "標準レイドコンテンツをオートバトルしない。GBFの標準レイド（インポッシブル難易度以下）は適切に構築されたチームで効率よくオートバトルできる。中盤以上では標準コンテンツを手動でクリアするのは時間の非効率。",
      "天司武器イベント（天の塔/バブルの塔）を見逃す。タワーはリヴァンズ武器の最も効率的な入手源で、限定イベントウィンドウ中にのみ利用可能。見逃すと終盤のウェポングリッドの完成が大幅に遅れる。"
